{"name":"Misty Violet","hex":"#dbd7e4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"misty","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered in mist; foggy.","Dim; vague; obscure."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/misty"},{"term":"violet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A plant or flower of the genus Viola, especially the fragrant Viola odorata;  similar-looking plants and flowers.","A person thought to resemble V. odorata, especially in its beauty and delicacy."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a violet colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/violet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Misty (Pokémon)","blocks":[{"text":"Misty, known as Kasumi  in Japan, is a fictional character in the Pokémon franchise owned by Nintendo and created by Satoshi Tajiri. She has appeared as a Gym Leader in the Pokémon video games Pokémon Red and Blue, Pokémon Gold and Silver and their respective remakes. She was a main character in the ongoing anime for the first five seasons, travelling alongside Ash Ketchum and Brock / Tracey to become a Water-type Pokémon Master before departing home to Cerulean City to run the family gym. The character has also appeared in manga like Pokémon Adventures. She specialises in Water-type Pokémon. Her Japanese voice actress is Mayumi Iizuka, while her English voice was supplied by Rachael Lillis and Michele Knotz."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/MistyEP.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misty_(Pok%C3%A9mon)","wikidata":"Q1057356"},{"title":"Violet (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Violet is the color of light at the short wavelength end of the visible spectrum. It is one of the seven colors that Isaac Newton labeled when dividing the spectrum of visible light in 1704. Violet light has a wavelength between approximately 380 and 435 nanometers. The color's name is derived from the Viola genus of flowers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Amatista_Laye_2.jpg/330px-Amatista_Laye_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_(color)","wikidata":"Q428124"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Chasublepurple.jpg/330px-Chasublepurple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Chasublepurple.jpg/330px-Chasublepurple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChasublepurple.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Manganese_violet.jpg/330px-Manganese_violet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Manganese_violet.jpg/330px-Manganese_violet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AManganese_violet.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg/500px-Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg/1280px-Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg/500px-Sweet_Violet_%28Viola_odorata%29_-_London%2C_Ontario.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%